---

## Conclusion
Unit 2 marks my progression from basic Kotlin programming toward developing interactive application concepts.  
It combines programming fundamentals with user interaction and state management, preparing me for more advanced concepts in Unit 3 (Form Handling & Data Storage) and Unit 4 (Lifecycle Awareness).
